      "type": "prose",
      "eyebrow": "Sector 5 · General workplace",
      "heading": "General workplace (HSE)",
      "text": "Every UK employer carries baseline duties under the Health and Safety at Work Act, the Regulatory Reform (Fire Safety) Order 2005, the Electricity at Work Regulations and RIDDOR. These apply on top of any sector-specific list above."
