        { "kicker": "Risk-assessed", "title": "PAT and fixed wiring", "text": "Portable appliance testing has no fixed legal interval; it is risk-assessed. Fixed electrical installations are commonly inspected (EICR) at intervals up to 5 years for many workplaces." },
        { "kicker": "Duty", "title": "First aid and RIDDOR", "text": "First aid needs assessed and kit checked regularly (commonly monthly). RIDDOR reporting is not a schedule; certain injuries, diseases and dangerous occurrences must be reported to the HSE when they happen." }
